Package: omapaint
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, quickshell
Description: lightweight QML drawing application for Omarchy
 OmaPaint is a small Paint-style drawing application built with Quickshell
 and QML. It supports drawing tools, shapes, text, layers, selections,
 undo/redo, image import and PNG export.
